[indent]•  兄：丁奉，字承渊，庐江安丰人，东吴名将，历仕[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孙权", "cat": "people"}]孙权[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孙亮", "cat": "people"}]孙亮[/url][/color]、孙休、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孙皓", "cat": "people"}]孙皓[/url][/color]四朝，官至右大司马左军师[/indent]
